00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:18,160
why bother trying to think rationally at all?

241
00:11:18,160 --> 00:11:20,560
Aren't I just running on a pre-programmed track?

242
00:11:20,560 --> 00:11:21,600
It's a fair question.

243
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:24,640
Why not just let your environment pull the levers and go to sleep at the wheel?

244
00:11:24,640 --> 00:11:25,520
Exactly.

245
00:11:25,520 --> 00:11:29,840
But the author's defense of rationality here is brilliantly unromantic.

246
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:31,200
It's pure pragmatism.

